# Each activation makes its own delayed triggered ability (CR 603.7): two Encampments activated on turn 5 (Black Lotus
# and three Moxen pay the two {2}{W}) trigger separately when the Ornithopter is declared as an attacker, so four tapped
# and attacking Warriors deal 4 combat damage (16), and all four are sacrificed together at the end step. Both
# Encampments entered untapped beside the Mountain.

